Package: saneabr
Type: Package
Title: Access Brazilian Sanitation Data from 'SNIS' and 'SINISA'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Théo", family = "de Paula", email = "theophd@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Downloads, caches and reads the municipal spreadsheets of the
    Brazilian National Sanitation Information Systems, 'SNIS' (Sistema
    Nacional de Informações sobre Saneamento, reference years 1995-2022) and
    its successor 'SINISA' (Sistema Nacional de Informações em Saneamento
    Básico, from 2023), published by the Ministry of Cities at
    <https://www.gov.br/cidades>. Files are fetched from the official source
    and checked against a versioned SHA-256 catalogue. Solid waste
    spreadsheets are parsed into tidy data frames with normalised variable
    codes and 7-digit 'IBGE' municipality codes. Includes data dictionaries
    and a documented correspondence table between 'SNIS' and 'SINISA'
    variable codes. The reading rules are shared with a 'Python' library of
    the same name.
